        "volume": 0.6
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4191_tippi_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "What a classic! That one's one of my favorites. It may be a small-budget production from thirty years ago, but it stands up perfectly well to today's films!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tippi"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1836_1#2$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Phew... watching horror movies really does help let off steam. I feel better already. Thanks for the invitation, Tip.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Shelly"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4191_tippi_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Like, doesn't it feel better to just scream it all out? I know you didn't mean to interrupt the shoot. You were just on edge.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tippi"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1836_1#2$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Yeah. I wouldn't say it's solved my issues... but at least I can forget about them for tonight. What are we watching next?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Shelly"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4191_tippi_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "I've got everything. Horror night has just begun!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tippi"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4191_tippi_1#2$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Hey, why so serious, Molly? You didn't like the movie?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tippi"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1831_1#9$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "I was just thinking...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Moira"
    },
    {
        "text": "That knife looked a little too thin. I think it'd have had more impact with a more intricate design, like blood grooves on the sides of the blade.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Moira"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4191_tippi_1#8$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "All work and no play makes Molly a dull girl! Turn off that work-brain already! Have you been spending too much time with Shelly?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tippi"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4198_christ_1#2$1",
        "duration": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_MCcat_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Mrrow~",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Miss.Christine"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4191_tippi_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Hey there, mystery lady. Whatcha doing here?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tippi"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4198_christ_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "The beautiful creature gets between the two girls, stretches, and sits in front of the sofa."
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4191_tippi_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Clever girl. Looks like she really likes us, Molly. You wanna watch a movie together? But it'll be scary, so don't say I didn't warn you.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tippi"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$phonevibration"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4191_tippi_1#4$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Hm? Whose terminal was that? Molly?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tippi"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1831_1#3$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Not mine.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Moira"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1836_1#4$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Shelly"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1836_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Sorry... I've got to go.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Shelly"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_walkfast"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "posfrom": "0,0",
        "posto": "200,0",
        "duration": 1,
        "afrom": 1,
        "ato": 0
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1831_1#4$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "She looked really pale. Do you think Miss Stone is pissed at her about what happened today?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Moira"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4191_tippi_1#9$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Let's try to be there for her tomorrow too. She looks really tired.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tippi"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1831_1#9$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Yeah.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Moira"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4191_tippi_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Alright, fasten your seatbelt, it's going to be a bumpy movie night! This one won Best Design. The background, props, and weapons are all really cool.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tippi"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "text": "The screen lights begin flashing again, immersing the two girls in another horror story. Neither of them notice that Miss.Christine is nowhere to be seen."
    },
    {
        "tag": "stopmusic",
        "fadetime": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
