    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "posfrom": "100,0",
        "posto": "0,0",
        "duration": 0.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$bodyfalldown2",
        "volume": 0.6
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_1838_1#6$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Shelly? I thought you were watching movies with Tip. What's the rush?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Michael"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_1836_1#4$1",
        "focus": "all"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "focus": "n"
    },
    {
        "text": "The overly friendly man notices that Shelly is clutching her terminal in her right hand."
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_1838_1#1$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Ah, I see... a sudden invitation to a date?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Michael"
    },
    {
        "text": "Well, try not to look so grim when you're there. I'm sure he'd rather see a smile.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Michael"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_1836_1#1$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "It's none of your business.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Shelly"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_1838_1#1$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Your lips are trembling. You're cold. Or maybe afraid?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Michael"
    },
    {
        "text": "You poor thing, you're still shaken about Dalton's accident, aren't you? Just like me.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Michael"
    },
    {
        "text": "Don't worry, with you as coordinator, I'm sure everything will go just fine. Come on, let me give you a hug. You could use the warmth.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Michael"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "posfrom": "0,0",
        "posto": "-100,0",
        "duration": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_clothmovement",
        "volume": 0.6
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 0.2,
        "xstrength": 15,
        "ystrength": 5,
        "vibrato": 10,
        "randomness": 90,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "posfrom": "0,0",
        "posto": "50,0",
        "duration": 0.3
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "posfrom": "-100,0",
        "posto": "100,0",
        "duration": 0.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_1836_1#1$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "What do you mean, 'just like me'?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Shelly"
    },
    {
        "text": "I couldn't hear an ounce of fear in that trashy pick-up line.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Shelly"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_1836_1#5$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Have you completely forgotten what happened five years ago?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Shelly"
    },
    {
        "text": "Well, I haven't, because I'm not heartless like you. Don't forget: you're not free from blame for that accident either.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Shelly"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_1838_1#5$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Michael"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_1836_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_walkfast"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "posfrom": "50,0",
        "posto": "300,0",
        "duration": 1,
        "afrom": 1,
        "ato": 0
    },
    {
