    },
    {
        "text": "The light abruptly turns on in the office on the second floor."
    },
    {
        "text": "On one desk, the papers are tidily filed away in folders, with hardly any sign of use."
    },
    {
        "text": "On the other, notices are scattered all over, covered in editing marks as though the writer is troubled by something."
    },
    {
        "text": "A tall figure searches around the desks, making not a single sound with his lithe and nimble motions."
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1828_1#1$1",
        "duration": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1.5
    },
    {
        "text": "Here.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lucian"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "focus": "n"
    },
    {
        "text": "The shredder has been used recently."
    },
    {
        "text": "Lucian opens the waste bin, and picks up several strips of shredded paper that feel different from the others, different from the printing paper normally used by the film crew."
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1828_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "'Trimounts University'... 'Environmental Monitoring'... signed... 'Greta'.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lucian"
    },
    {
        "text": "The 'unusual document' that Shelly mentioned.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lucian"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "focus": "n"
    },
    {
        "text": "He feels a slight push on his shoulder, seemingly in affirmation, but there is no one else in the room."
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1828_1#11$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Welcome back, Miss.Christine.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lucian"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4198_christ_1#1$1",
        "duration": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1828_1#12$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "You've been taking more walks lately. Did something here catch your eye?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lucian"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4198_christ_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "This place is more interesting than expected.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Miss.Christine"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1828_1#5$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Indeed. I've discovered something unexpected myself.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lucian"
    },
    {
        "tag": "stopmusic",
        "fadetime": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
