    {
        "tag": "background",
        "image": "bg_warehouse",
        "screenadapt": "coverall"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "playmusic",
        "intro": "$suspenseful_intro",
        "key": "$suspenseful_loop",
        "volume": 0.6
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1836_1#4$1",
        "duration": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Don't overthink this, Shelly... You're only here to see who's playing this sick joke.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Shelly"
    },
    {
        "text": "You saw that number become invalid with your own eyes. It... it can't be...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Shelly"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "focus": "n"
    },
    {
        "text": "Shelly tries her best to calm down. The fear and anxiety she had briefly forgotten while watching the movie now takes over again."
    },
    {
        "text": "'Go to the warehouse and atone for your sins.'"
    },
    {
        "text": "The terminal's screen glows in the quiet warehouse, showing the name of the sender. A name that is familiar, yet impossible\u2014'Laura'."
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 0.2,
        "xstrength": 10,
        "ystrength": 10,
        "vibrato": 30,
        "randomness": 90,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_glass_break"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1836_1#5$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Who's there?!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Shelly"
    },
    {
        "text": "Stop playing games. I know I'm not hearing things this time! What the hell do you want from me?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Shelly"
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 0.3,
        "xstrength": 30,
        "ystrength": 30,
        "vibrato": 30,
        "randomness": 90,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "text": "What do you know?!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Shelly"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "text": "There is no answer. The darkness swallows all sound in the old warehouse."
    },
    {
        "text": "She hears the tiny buzzing of electricity. A light suddenly comes on above a distant shelf."
    },
    {
        "text": "As eerie as it is enticing, Shelly cannot help but walk toward it."
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1848_1#1$1",
        "duration": 1.5,
        "afrom": 0,
        "ato": 0.8
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2.5
    },
    {
        "text": "Shelly.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "???"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1836_1#6$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Laura... is that you?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Shelly"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "text": "Once again, Shelly starts trembling. She cannot tell if the sound came from deep within the warehouse, or from inside her own head."
    },
    {
        "text": "She walks forward in a daze. It is as if she has returned to that set five years ago, where the tragedy occurred."
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1848_1#1$1",
        "afrom": 0.8,
        "ato": 0.8
    },
    {
        "text": "Shelly! I just got another scene and I need the wire rig. Can you prepare it for me?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "???"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1836_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Arrogant... cocky... proud... how dare you, a fresh face in Wrankwood...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Shelly"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1848_1#1$1",
        "afrom": 0.8,
        "ato": 0.8
    },
    {
        "text": "Mr. Dalton said the director signed off on it...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "???"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1836_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Dalton, still a star at the time, wanted to teach you a lesson, but you thought he was helping you... Are you happy with how it turned out?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Shelly"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1848_1#1$1",
        "afrom": 0.8,
        "ato": 0.8
    },
    {
        "text": "Is he not here yet? I've spent hours up in this rig. My knees and elbows are probably bleeding by now... Can you please ask them for me, Shelly?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "???"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1836_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'm just a coordinator. All I can do is prepare the equipment and the rig. Make sure they're... safe...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Shelly"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1848_1#1$1",
        "afrom": 0.8,
        "ato": 0.8
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1.5
    },
    {
        "text": "Well, did you?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "???"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "stopmusic",
        "fadetime": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "duration": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_gen_walk_n"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1836_1#6$1",
        "duration": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "focus": "n"
    },
    {
        "text": "Shelly arrives before the shelf. The light shines upon a black dust bag. She knows what is inside."
    },
    {
        "text": "Don't open it, Shelly. Don't."
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_zipper_normal",
        "loop": true,
        "channel": "v"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "stopsound",
        "channel": "v",
        "fadetime": 0.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "playmusic",
        "intro": "$drift_intro",
        "key": "$drift_loop",
        "volume": 0.6
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 0.3,
        "xstrength": 30,
        "ystrength": 30,
        "vibrato": 20,
        "randomness": 90,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1836_1#3$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "!!!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Shelly"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "text": "Inside is an old wire rig set. The hook and tether are badly worn, and the harness is frayed."
    },
    {
        "text": "There are dark spots on the black cloth."
    },
    {
        "text": "Laura's blood."
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 0.3,
        "xstrength": 30,
        "ystrength": 30,
        "vibrato": 30,
        "randomness": 90,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1836_1#5$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "No! You can't possibly know!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Shelly"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1836_1#4$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "You're just a hallucination! You can't be alive! Right... pain... I brought a pen...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Shelly"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_daggerslow",
        "loop": true,
        "channel": "a"
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 0.2,
        "xstrength": 10,
        "ystrength": 10,
        "vibrato": 20,
        "randomness": 90,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0.2,
        "r": 0.7,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 0.5,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "stopsound",
        "channel": "a",
        "fadetime": 0
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1836_1#4$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Ngh\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Shelly"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1848_1#1$1",
        "afrom": 0.8,
        "ato": 0.8
    },
    {
        "text": "...How pathetic.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "???"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1836_1#4$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Why are you still there... Why didn't it work?!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Shelly"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1848_1#1$1",
        "afrom": 0.8,
        "ato": 0.8
    },
    {
        "text": "Was the incident five years ago an accident... or a murder?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "???"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1836_1#5$1"
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 0.3,
        "xstrength": 30,
        "ystrength": 30,
        "vibrato": 30,
        "randomness": 90,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "text": "An accident... it was an accident! It was a tragic accident that only happened because Dalton held a grudge against you!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Shelly"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1848_1#1$1",
        "afrom": 0.8,
        "ato": 0.8
    },
    {
        "text": "Then why didn't you check my rig?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "???"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1836_1#4$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "I...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Shelly"
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 0.3,
        "xstrength": 30,
        "ystrength": 30,
        "vibrato": 30,
        "randomness": 90,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1848_1#1$1",
        "afrom": 0.8,
        "ato": 0.8
    },
    {
        "text": "Why?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "???"
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 0.3,
        "xstrength": 30,
        "ystrength": 30,
        "vibrato": 30,
        "randomness": 90,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1836_1#5$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Because I hated you!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Shelly"
    },
    {
        "text": "I hated your selfishness and arrogance! I hated that you made a mess out of the shooting schedule, and affected everyone with your unreasonable demands!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Shelly"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1836_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "I was happy when Dalton decided to teach you a lesson! I was checking the wire rig as usual, and noticed it was due for replacement.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Shelly"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1836_1#4$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Then, a little thought crossed my mind. What if an accident happened, and you were gone forever...?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Shelly"
    },
    {
        "text": "Wouldn't that be... even better...?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Shelly"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
