    },
    {
        "text": "Still in a trance, a hand pushes Shelly over. She hears the sound of coolant flowing through the pipes, and frost cracking beneath her."
    },
    {
        "text": "She realizes that she had stumbled into the cold storage at the end of the warehouse."
    },
    {
        "text": "But what can she do? Bang on the door? Shout? She has no strength left to struggle."
    },
    {
        "text": "......"
    },
    {
        "text": "The fear is gone. She feels completely relaxed."
    },
    {
        "text": "......"
    },
    {
        "text": "......"
    },
    {
        "text": "Death has answered all her questions."
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
